From f8ed3b2634ab332cd969f36e6a48abb3ac592d85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tien Nguyen <tien.nguyen.uh@renesas.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Dec 2025 09:33:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] moal: assign per-instance lockdep class to moal_lock

Assign a per-instance lockdep class to each dynamically allocated moal_lock
to avoid lockdep false positives when different moal_lock instances are
nested in the SDIO IRQ thread. Also init flags and unregister the key before
freeing.

